<title>POLAND: BUDIMEX SUBSIDIARY SIGNS $8.1 MLN DEAL.</title>
<headline>BUDIMEX SUBSIDIARY SIGNS $8.1 MLN DEAL.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish construction firm Unibud SA, 49.9-percent owned by Budimex before its recent public offering, has signed an $8.1 million contract to build a block of flats in Warsaw, Unibud said in a statement.</p>
<p>Unibud's one-million-share initial public offering in January at 15 zlotys each was heavily oversubscribed.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
